Don't tell me... You have amnesia?!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:29.500
Huh?

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:35.400
How sad! Being assaulted by the principal was a huge shock, wasn't it?

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:40.870
But why was she wearing a boy's clothes?

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:44.670
There must be some deep, unknown reason for this.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.810
I know! {Re-time.}

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:49.480
Until you recover your memories, I'll take care of you!{Time.}

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.900
Why?!

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.400
Yuuki-kun turned into a girl?!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.910
The shock was too much, so he ran away from home.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.700
Now that you mention it, the person we bumped into earlier...

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.080
You two bumped into Rito?

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.170
Maybe? Let me try drawing a sketch.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.170
Sketch?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:12.490
She looked like this!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.400
I-I don't really see it...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:17.970
Haruna!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:18.760
Lala-san!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:23.630
I've completed the item that will turn Rito back into his original form, so I'm going to go look for him!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.190
