00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.790
Once we're done eating, let's all bathe together.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.040
Yes, Saki-sama.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.660
Okay, Riko-san?

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:54.420
Huh? Bath?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:58.430
Take a good look. This bath is the pride of the Tenjouin family.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:00.930
The bath again! {Re-time so the beginning shows later.}

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.210
What do you think? Wonderful, isn't it?

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.890
Uhh... I-I'll pass...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:07.850
Wait! {Time.}

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:13.860
Even if it's just a little, Saki-sama sincerely wants to help relieve the anxiety that you're feeling. So please...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.690
