00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:26.030
Tenjouin-senpai's feelings are definitely getting across to me...

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:31.310
Yeah, I guess she really is wholly caring and gentle.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:35.260
