00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:52.270
I wanted to shower, but...

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.420
Riko, please come with me! {Re-time.}

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.700
Let's relax in the bath together. {Time.}

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.100
It feels good!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:22.410
There's nowhere I can safely look! {Re-time.}

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:26.150
If I stay like this and never return to my original form... {Time.}

